bags/lares/ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/shelter-against-empire.mem:68:''And the Gaia parallel needs no drawing out.'' Kingdoms overthrown and their language nearly ended; peoples enrolled, counted, and relocated by registry; networks shut on unproven accusation; platforms that hold the membership list and can delete it by deleting a row. The fiction sets it five centuries after a collapse so the shape reads clearly — and the shape belongs to 2026, not 4326.
