bags/lares/ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/live-equivocation.mem:16:role              = "live-equivocation — the exposure the federated-mesh collision named (Fork C, 2026-09-09): detection catches a live-key equivocator but cannot PREVENT it, and KERI has no admin recovery for a live current+next capture, so that case falls only to recovery-quorum — which the roadmap built last. Recovery and detection each sit in the other's blind spot; pull recovery FORWARD beside the sensorium. This meme LOGS the exposure for later research spirits to resolve with outside negentropy + load-bearing fiction user stories, and frames Elyncia's DreamNet as the first QA world."
