bags/lares/ha.ka.ba/lares/docs/art-sigils/example-zero-folio.mem:152:These URIs serve *non-depicted reference metadata*, not subject labels or commands to insert photographic prints into the board. Each resource supplies a different observational standpoint; none establishes the final geography of Elyncia's Olympos. An AI lacking URL retrieval needs the reference supplied as an attached image or a separately described observation. Preserve source credit and original license when reusing photographic material.
